<title>USA: West Irondequoit CSD, N.Y. won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>West Irondequoit CSD, N.Y. won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $3.1 million of West Irondequoit CSD, N.Y., school district 1997 general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.8679 percent.</p>
